# Deploy at end of every task

**Rule:** At the end of **every** task that changes code or content, you **must** deploy to GitHub.

- Stage relevant files (e.g. `git add app/ components/ docs/` or the files you changed).
- Commit with a clear message.
- Push to `origin main`: `git push origin main`.

This is **not optional**. The user expects the repo to be up to date after each task so Vercel (or other CI) can deploy.

If the task did not touch any files, skip deployment.
